try\n41\t- TrustyAI\n42\t- Notebooks\n43\t- Training Operator\n44\t\n45\t## Out of Scope\n46\t\n47\t- Log storage, retention, or forwarding infrastructure\n48\t- Metrics and tracing conventions (logging only)\n49\t\n50\t## Open Questions\n51\t\n52\tNone — the convention work (HLR-1) is prerequisite design, and per-component\n53\tadoptions are mechanical once it lands.\n54\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"chatcmpl-tool-b9eef36f4afb0ec1","agent_id":"a92316ca9b9654ed3","session_id":"2dd626cf-a93a-4e25-8251-bda4870c451e","uuid":"805c49ac-d868-4265-a527-c1f46ee95ee7","timestamp":"2026-10-21T22:28:11.068Z","tool_result_meta":[{"id":"chatcmpl-tool-bb98c3e51668ce8e","permission_decision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reason_type":"mode"}}],"subagent_type":"general-purpose","task_description":"Revise RHAISTRAT-9011 decomposition"}
